{"publicId":"2facd19e-7318-4f82-89c9-766632f1dfa1","title":"Leucomyxa quisqueyensis 新种描述及基因组比较研究","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","digest":"多米尼加共和国研究团队在 bioRxiv 发布预印本，首次描述了淡水排水渠中的新型无色阿米巴状隐藻 Leucomyxa quisqueyensis sp. nov.，其多核网状结构与 Leucomyxa plasmidifera 的核基因组存在 15.26% 的差异。该研究通过比较基因组分析，揭示了阿米巴状隐藻的叶绿体进化机制与网状结构形成的关系，但尚未完成同行评审。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-16T20:32:27.490Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Leucomyxa quisqueyensis 新种描述","latestReport":{"id":"x78kybzjto6x0nnwjayekpu83"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fMNvToxkn5vY","title":"Leucomyxa quisqueyensis 新种描述","firstReportAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"x78kybzjto6x0nnwjayekpu83","title":"Leucomyxa quisqueyensis 新种描述","summary":"研究描述了来自多米尼加共和国淡水排水渠的新型无色淡水阿米巴状隐藻 Leucomyxa quisqueyensis sp. nov.，其特征为形成广泛的多核网状结构，与 Leucomyxa plasmidifera 的核基因组距离为 15.26%。该研究提供了比较相关阿米巴状隐藻网状结构和叶绿体进化的基础。","source":{"name":"bioRxiv","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[{"id":"x78kybzjto6x0nnwjayekpu83","title":"Leucomyxa quisqueyensis 新种描述","summary":"研究描述了来自多米尼加共和国淡水排水渠的新型无色淡水阿米巴状隐藻 Leucomyxa quisqueyensis sp. nov.，其特征为形成广泛的多核网状结构，与 Leucomyxa plasmidifera 的核基因组距离为 15.26%。该研究提供了比较相关阿米巴状隐藻网状结构和叶绿体进化的基础。","source":{"name":"bioRxiv","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","selected":false}],"timeline":[{"id":"x78kybzjto6x0nnwjayekpu83","title":"Leucomyxa quisqueyensis 新种描述","summary":"研究描述了来自多米尼加共和国淡水排水渠的新型无色淡水阿米巴状隐藻 Leucomyxa quisqueyensis sp. nov.，其特征为形成广泛的多核网状结构，与 Leucomyxa plasmidifera 的核基因组距离为 15.26%。该研究提供了比较相关阿米巴状隐藻网状结构和叶绿体进化的基础。","source":{"name":"bioRxiv","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-16T21:00:00.000Z","heat":5.5,"participants":1}